 ],
 "what_it_is": "Objects that the Dark Energy Survey listed as T-dwarf candidates from colours alone (Dal Ponte et al. 2023; Carnero Rosell et al. 2019). We found no published spectrum of them in four compilations, in their source tables or in SIMBAD (where they have no entry at all). Their SPHEREx spectra show methane absorption. This is a first spectroscopic confirmation of their nature at SPHEREx resolution, not the discovery of new objects, and it should be checked with a proper spectrum before it is published."
